From 76534c79bff5ef5d211bbf6ac71b9b1746755adb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Maxime=20M=C3=A9r=C3=A9?= <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 15:32:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 871/913] core: firewall: acknowledge snprintf return value
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

firewall_dt_get_alternate_conf() built prop_name with snprintf()
without checking or acknowledging the return value.

Cast the call to (void), matching this codebase's convention for
intentionally unchecked snprintf() calls.

Coverity issue: CID 1200225: CERT-C Error Handling
Coverity issue: CID 1200302: CERT-C POSIX

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git c395fc54895adc045ff22744ee580959656aa0b0 core: firewall: acknowledge snprintf return value]
Assisted-by: GitHub-Copilot:Claude-Sonnet-5
Signed-off-by: Maxime Méré <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I3797643123bca2702f309731df97b3908dc84137
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/592847
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Domain-Review: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
---
 core/drivers/firewall/firewall.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/core/drivers/firewall/firewall.c b/core/drivers/firewall/firewall.c
index 8ef104e9e..5066a51c6 100644
--- a/core/drivers/firewall/firewall.c
+++ b/core/drivers/firewall/firewall.c
@@ -111,7 +111,8 @@ TEE_Result firewall_dt_get_alternate_conf(const void *fdt, int node,
 	if (!prop_name)
 		return TEE_ERROR_OUT_OF_MEMORY;
 
-	snprintf(prop_name, max_len, "access-controllers-conf-%s", conf_name);
+	(void)snprintf(prop_name, max_len, "access-controllers-conf-%s",
+		       conf_name);
 	res = dt_driver_count_devices(prop_name, fdt, node, DT_DRIVER_FIREWALL,
 				      &nb_element);
 	if (res) {
-- 
2.53.0

